<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Kratom Resources</title>

    <!-- Correct CSS path -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #f4f7f4;
            color: #243024;
        }

        .headerWrapper {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #333;
            padding: 10px 0;
        }

        .navbar ul {
            list-style-type: none;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .navbar li {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
        }

        .navbar a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .navbar a:hover {
            color: #ffcc00;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #234b2c;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 35px auto;
            padding: 0 25px 50px;
        }

        section {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        img {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 25px auto 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .caption {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #5d665d;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            margin: 0 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Navigation Bar -->
    <div class="headerWrapper">
        <div class="navbar">
            <ul>
                <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="risks.html">Health Risks</a></li>
                <li><a href="effects.html">Effects</a></li>
                <li><a href="dependence.html">Dependence & Withdrawal</a></li>
                <li><a href="resources.html">Resources</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <header>
        <h1>Kratom Resources</h1>
    </header>

    <!-- FIXED IMAGE: your filename had a space, which breaks GitHub Pages -->
    <img src="images/kratom-warning.png" alt="Public health warning graphic about kratom">

    <p class="caption">
        Public health resources provide guidance and support for individuals affected by kratom.
    </p>

    <p class="caption">
        Graphic credit: Public Health Communications Collaborative (Educational Use)
    </p>

    <main>
        <section>
            <h2>Learning More About Kratom</h2>

            <p>
                Learning about kratom from reliable sources can help people better understand 
                its possible effects and risks. The following websites provide additional 
                information about kratom and substance abuse.
            </p>

            <img 
                src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Kratom_plant.jpg"
                alt="Kratom plant leaves used in kratom products"
            >
            <p class="caption">
                Kratom plant. Image: Wikimedia Commons, CC0.
            </p>

            <h3>Helpful Resources</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://www.fda.gov/news-events/public-health-focus/fda-and-kratom" 
                       target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                       U.S. FDA – Kratom Information
                    </a>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <a href="https://www.cdc.gov/drugoverdose/data/kratom.html" 
                       target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                       CDC – Kratom Data & Reports
                    </a>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <a href="https://www.samhsa.gov/" 
                       target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                       SAMHSA – Substance Abuse Resources
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul>

        </section>
    </main>

</body>
</html>

